    "body": "v2.0.1.61\r\nModule / Certificate download page\r\n\r\nv2.0.0.15\r\ncorrected the status api\r\npower to voltage config for battery view\r\n\r\nv2.0.0.3:\r\nRuntime library ported to PLibESPV1\r\nImplemented frontend language support (english/german)\r\nCrashes caused by communication removed\r\nNew Info page at startup shows also the status of the device\r\nLogin only necessary for administrative tasks\r\nUser can view remotes and scan WiFi without authentication"
